      "description": "Actual fallback state and unboxed metadata. Placeholder labels stand in for API facts; no fabricated photograph, price or condition.",
      "html": "<article class=\"ds-card\"><a class=\"ds-cover\" href=\"#ds-book\" aria-label=\"Xem sách\"><svg width=\"30\" height=\"30\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"/><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h3a6 6 0 0 1 6 3 6 6 0 0 1 6-3h3a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-3a6 6 0 0 0-6 3 6 6 0 0 0-6-3z\"/></svg><span>Chưa có ảnh bìa</span></a><div class=\"ds-meta\"><p class=\"ds-condition-text\">Tình trạng · Hình thức từ API</p><h3 class=\"ds-card-title\"><a href=\"#ds-book\">Tên sách từ API</a></h3><p class=\"ds-author\">Tác giả từ API</p><div class=\"ds-prices\"><p><span>Giá bán</span><strong>Giá từ API</strong></p><p><span>Giá trị đổi</span><strong>Giá trị từ API</strong></p></div><a class=\"ds-view\" href=\"#ds-book\">Xem sách</a></div></article>",
      "css": ".ds-card{font-family:var(--shop-body,'Be Vietnam Pro',sans-serif);max-width:260px;min-width:0;color:var(--shop-ink,#281914)}.ds-cover{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;aspect-ratio:4/5;padding:26px;border-radius:12px;background:#f0e2ca;color:#614e42;text-decoration:none;font-size:.8rem}.ds-meta{padding-top:17px}.ds-condition-text{font-size:.72rem;color:var(--shop-muted,#716157);margin:0 0 7px;line-height:1.5}.ds-card-title{font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:700;line-height:1.5;margin:0 0 4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-card-title a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}.ds-card-title a:hover,.ds-view:hover{text-decoration:underline}.ds-author{font-size:.8rem;color:var(--shop-muted,#716157);margin:0 0 14px;line-height:1.6}.ds-prices{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 20px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-prices p{display:grid;gap:4px;margin:0}.ds-prices span{font-size:.7rem;color:var(--shop-muted,#716157)}.ds-prices strong{font-size:1rem;color:var(--shop-wine,#5c0202)}.ds-view{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;min-height:44px;margin-top:5px;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--shop-wine,#5c0202);text-decoration:none}.ds-card a:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--shop-wine,#5c0202);outline-offset:4px}"
    },
